WEBVTT

00:16.380 --> 00:19.980
<b>Your eyes that look far off
into the distance</b>

00:19.980 --> 00:23.620
<b>They're listening to the voice
within your heart</b>

00:23.620 --> 00:27.610
<b>Embracing a still blue moon</b>

00:30.990 --> 00:34.530
<b>Your strength to keep on running</b>

00:34.530 --> 00:38.200
<b>Will open another new door for you</b>

00:38.200 --> 00:42.160
<b>Illuminate the night that
dawns too soon</b>

00:45.510 --> 00:52.750
<b>Even alone, I want to keep on
believing in you</b>

00:52.750 --> 01:00.060
<b>It's in such a moment that
this world will begin to stir</b>

01:00.060 --> 01:03.690
<b>What should we be searching for?</b>

01:03.690 --> 01:07.300
<b>Send out your soul</b>

01:07.300 --> 01:14.570
<b>We'll meet here again someday,
if that's the truth</b>

01:14.570 --> 01:18.210
<b>What should we fix our gaze upon?</b>

01:18.210 --> 01:24.950
<b>The reality that I reached out
and grabbed with my hand</b>

01:24.950 --> 01:28.710
<b>Let it go, let's believe in it</b>

01:32.250 --> 01:33.790
<b>I'm hot!</b>

01:33.790 --> 01:37.690
<b>Shut up, you stupid monkey! Your
hot air is just making it hotter!</b>

01:37.690 --> 01:41.500
<b>What, roach-head?! Your overgrown
hair's way more obnoxious!</b>

01:41.500 --> 01:42.600
<b>Cut your hair, Gojyo!</b>

01:42.600 --> 01:43.730
<b>What did you say?!</b>

01:43.730 --> 01:46.170
<b>Hakkai, how far until the next town?</b>

01:46.170 --> 01:50.770
<b>According to the map, the town of
Tofugai should be coming up soon.</b>

01:50.770 --> 01:53.180
<b>Hakkai, if we don't get the pervy
water sprite to a town soon,</b>

01:53.180 --> 01:55.910
<b>the saucer on his head's
gonna dry out.</b>

01:57.610 --> 01:59.650
<b>We have no more water after all.</b>

01:59.650 --> 02:02.850
<b>Yeah, yeah, we had this
conversation yesterday.</b>

02:14.400 --> 02:17.000
<b>What the hell were you
looking at, Hakkai?!</b>

02:17.000 --> 02:19.660
<b>What, was there a cat or something
in this vast wasteland?!</b>

02:27.840 --> 02:29.980
<b>A woman... And she's...</b>

02:29.980 --> 02:31.670
<b>A demon?</b>

02:32.410 --> 02:33.880
<b>Please,</b>

02:34.950 --> 02:37.720
<b>take me to the town</b>

02:37.720 --> 02:39.190
<b>of Tofugai.</b>

02:55.000 --> 02:59.340
<b>But you know, here we are saving
a mysterious demon.</b>

02:59.340 --> 03:02.540
<b>I just don't get what goes on
inside that monk's head.</b>

03:02.540 --> 03:06.180
<b>What's wrong with that? We were
headed for Tofugai anyway.</b>

03:06.180 --> 03:08.120
<b>That's not the issue here!</b>

03:08.120 --> 03:11.150
<b>Are you really sure about this, Sanzo?</b>

03:11.150 --> 03:15.620
<b>I sense neither evil nor
hostility from her.</b>

03:15.620 --> 03:20.260
<b>We'll just have to go to this
Tofugai and see.</b>

03:20.260 --> 03:23.030
<b>Well, I suppose you have a point.</b>

03:27.400 --> 03:29.530
<b>Wow, what the heck is this place?!</b>

03:30.210 --> 03:34.380
<b>My town, Tofugai, is at the
bottom of this gorge.</b>

03:34.380 --> 03:36.570
<b>You were awake?</b>

03:37.180 --> 03:41.740
<b>In return for having saved me,
I shall be your guide.</b>

03:43.180 --> 03:44.290
<b>Go down.</b>

03:44.290 --> 03:45.450
<b>What?!</b>

03:45.450 --> 03:53.600
<b>But Sanzo, Hakuryu's unable
to fly in his current form.</b>

03:53.600 --> 03:55.430
<b>Who asked him to fly?</b>

03:55.430 --> 03:58.100
<b>I believe all I said was to go down.</b>

03:58.100 --> 04:01.000
<b>Oh, you leave me no choice then.</b>

04:01.000 --> 04:03.740
<b>Hakkai, wipe that smile off your face!</b>

04:03.740 --> 04:05.970
<b>Please hang on tight!</b>

04:08.010 --> 04:09.480
<b>Hakuryu, here we go!</b>

04:18.020 --> 04:20.490
<b>It's totally dark down there!
I can't see a thing!</b>

04:24.290 --> 04:25.760
<b>This mist...</b>

04:27.960 --> 04:29.560
<b>Hakkai, you bastard!</b>

04:29.560 --> 04:32.070
<b>How can you pull a crazy stunt like
that without breaking a sweat?!</b>

04:32.070 --> 04:34.800
<b>This mist is really thick.</b>

04:34.800 --> 04:36.270
<b>What the heck is this?</b>

04:36.970 --> 04:38.440
<b>Who knows?</b>

04:40.280 --> 04:42.300
<b>Woman, what's the big idea?</b>

04:44.380 --> 04:45.880
<b>An earthquake?</b>

04:45.880 --> 04:49.080
<b>This town's on the verge
of being swallowed up.</b>

04:49.080 --> 04:51.320
<b>Swallowed up? By what?</b>

04:51.320 --> 04:53.290
<b>I don't know.</b>

04:53.290 --> 04:58.090
<b>My only duty is to be your guide.</b>

05:09.600 --> 05:13.740
<b>Please wait here. I'll go
open the gates.</b>

05:13.740 --> 05:17.710
<b>When you enter the town,
please come to the tower.</b>

05:17.710 --> 05:19.980
<b>I shall be waiting for you there.</b>

05:21.780 --> 05:24.490
<b>Do you think we'll be okay?</b>

05:24.490 --> 05:27.820
<b>We've come this far. What
will happen will happen.</b>

05:28.360 --> 05:31.460
<b>Here I thought he saved her
out of mercy,</b>

05:31.460 --> 05:33.460
<b>but it turns out he wasn't
thinking at all.</b>

05:33.460 --> 05:35.090
<b>Some monk, if you ask me.</b>

05:36.700 --> 05:40.000
<b>Hey, those things are for smacking
people with, not throwing!</b>

05:47.540 --> 05:49.980
<b>What could this light be?</b>

05:49.980 --> 05:54.010
<b>Who knows? But I sense
no danger or evil.</b>

05:54.750 --> 05:56.410
<b>In that case, shall we go?</b>

06:00.760 --> 06:06.160
<b>My Lady Gyokumen Koushu, I trust
you're in excellent health?</b>

06:06.160 --> 06:09.060
<b>I'm busy. Never mind the formalities,</b>

06:09.060 --> 06:10.570
<b>just tell me why you're here.</b>

06:10.570 --> 06:15.760
<b>Oh, a thousand pardons, I shall
deliver my report right away then.</b>

06:20.380 --> 06:21.380
<b>Did you tell her?</b>

06:21.380 --> 06:25.540
<b>Our Lady Gyokumen Koushu
is extremely busy,</b>

06:27.380 --> 06:32.190
<b>and it doesn't please her to be
bothered by a town in the desert.</b>

06:32.190 --> 06:36.460
<b>Wait a minute! This place, Tofugai...</b>

06:36.460 --> 06:39.790
<b>It has demons who've kept their
sense of self, on top of which...</b>

06:39.790 --> 06:41.530
<b>Wait a minute!</b>

06:41.530 --> 06:43.400
<b>Getting mad like that will
irritate your skin,</b>

06:43.400 --> 06:45.530
<b>on top of which, you'll get
liver spots and pimples.</b>

06:46.300 --> 06:48.900
<b>Don't mock me! On top of which,
according to the reports,</b>

06:48.900 --> 06:52.370
<b>THAT group is passing near the town!</b>

06:52.370 --> 06:57.080
<b>It seems it doesn't please
Lady Gyokumen Koushu</b>

06:57.080 --> 07:00.050
<b>to worry about such a localized town.</b>

07:00.050 --> 07:05.180
<b>Or are you displeased with Lady
Gyokumen Koushu's inclinations?</b>

07:09.820 --> 07:13.260
<b>Oh? Doctor Huang, are you going
to offer counsel yourself?</b>

07:13.260 --> 07:15.830
<b>No, I'm going to the washroom!</b>

07:15.830 --> 07:17.900
<b>The ladies' room is on the right side</b>

07:17.900 --> 07:19.600
<b>At the end of the hallway to your left.</b>

07:19.600 --> 07:21.070
<b>I know that!</b>

07:29.280 --> 07:31.380
<b>There's no one in this town.</b>

07:31.380 --> 07:33.210
<b>Is it one of those so-called
ghost towns?</b>

07:36.650 --> 07:38.120
<b>Sanzo, look!</b>

07:42.790 --> 07:45.490
<b>Are all the inhabitants here
sculptors or what?</b>

07:45.490 --> 07:47.360
<b>They've got awful taste!</b>

07:47.360 --> 07:50.630
<b>We can't keep on going
in Hakuryu through this.</b>

07:51.800 --> 07:53.990
<b>It seems we have no choice
but to go by foot.</b>

07:59.670 --> 08:04.150
<b>These guys don't seem to be
just ordinary statues.</b>

08:04.150 --> 08:06.640
<b>What're you talking about, Sanzo?</b>

08:07.920 --> 08:13.420
<b>These stone statues may be what
became of this town's inhabitants.</b>

08:13.420 --> 08:16.460
<b>They might have become stone
for some reason,</b>

08:16.460 --> 08:19.260
<b>or they were possibly turned
into stone by someone else.</b>

08:28.540 --> 08:29.800
<b>Sanzo...</b>

08:29.800 --> 08:31.270
<b>What in the world?</b>

08:33.610 --> 08:35.410
<b>Let's head for the tower.</b>

08:35.410 --> 08:37.400
<b>That woman should know
something about this.</b>

08:41.180 --> 08:42.680
<b>Where are you?!</b>

08:42.680 --> 08:45.080
<b>We came this far like you told us to!</b>

08:46.550 --> 08:49.160
<b>Come on out! Come on out and...</b>

08:49.160 --> 08:54.760
<b>Sanzo, please don't kill any more
of our fellow townspeople.</b>

08:54.760 --> 08:55.960
<b>What?</b>

08:55.960 --> 09:01.270
<b>They're weak and unable
to withstand your energy.</b>

09:01.270 --> 09:06.070
<b>What's the meaning of all this?
Why did you bring us here?</b>

09:06.070 --> 09:09.140
<b>To test you.</b>

09:09.140 --> 09:10.650
<b>Test?</b>

09:10.650 --> 09:15.780
<b>I shall tell all to the chosen ones
who overcome the trial.</b>

09:15.780 --> 09:18.620
<b>That's a pretty self-centered statement.</b>

09:21.720 --> 09:23.890
<b>What the hell is this?!</b>

09:23.890 --> 09:24.360
<b>What's wrong?!</b>

09:24.360 --> 09:25.390
<b>I don't know!
What's wrong?!</b>

09:25.390 --> 09:25.830
<b>I don't know!</b>

09:29.060 --> 09:30.970
<b>I'm turning into stone!</b>

09:30.970 --> 09:32.900
<b>You gotta be kidding me, damn it!</b>

09:32.900 --> 09:34.830
<b>Sanzo, this is a trap! Please run!</b>

09:35.440 --> 09:36.900
<b>You guys!</b>

09:39.470 --> 09:42.440
<b>Don't tell me if I touch these
guys they'll also...</b>

09:44.310 --> 09:47.540
<b>She brought us here so she
could spring this trap then?</b>

09:50.450 --> 09:52.280
<b>You've got to be joking.</b>

09:55.560 --> 09:57.430
<b>So, you've finally shown yourself?</b>

09:57.430 --> 10:02.560
<b>Now, I clearly know the true nature
of your friends.</b>

10:02.560 --> 10:04.970
<b>You're the only one who remains.</b>

10:04.970 --> 10:07.800
<b>Never mind, just turn them back
to the way they were!</b>

10:07.800 --> 10:10.970
<b>I don't have the time to put up
with your impertinence!</b>

10:12.240 --> 10:14.270
<b>My name's Kouran.</b>

10:15.340 --> 10:18.970
<b>It's all in accordance with
Master Wuhan's will.</b>

10:22.920 --> 10:25.550
<b>"Four holy men will soon arrive.</b>

10:25.550 --> 10:30.390
<b>If they be demon, they'll
turn to stone in the city.</b>

10:30.390 --> 10:34.130
<b>If they be human, they'll
surely help us."</b>

10:34.130 --> 10:36.300
<b>It's Master Wuhan's prophecy.</b>

10:36.300 --> 10:37.760
<b>Wuhan?</b>

10:41.700 --> 10:43.710
<b>In accordance with
Master Wuhan's will,</b>

10:43.710 --> 10:47.140
<b>my role was to bring those men here.</b>

10:47.140 --> 10:51.180
<b>However, it seems I've brought
the wrong men.</b>

10:51.180 --> 10:52.650
<b>Such villainous...</b>

10:52.650 --> 10:54.110
<b>Don't be ridiculous!</b>

10:55.850 --> 10:57.280
<b>You're not getting away!</b>

11:01.520 --> 11:03.460
<b>Woman, don't underestimate me.</b>

11:19.370 --> 11:22.040
<b>What's that woman up to?</b>

11:58.010 --> 11:59.840
<b>Who are these guys?</b>

12:04.420 --> 12:06.990
<b>They can see it too.</b>

12:06.990 --> 12:08.060
<b>What?</b>

12:08.060 --> 12:10.530
<b>The energy the chosen have
is so strong,</b>

12:10.530 --> 12:14.760
<b>it could even destroy the
demons living here.</b>

12:14.760 --> 12:19.630
<b>The chosen? Energy? What
foolishness is this?</b>

12:19.630 --> 12:22.570
<b>You've been chosen by Master Wuhan.</b>

12:22.570 --> 12:24.300
<b>And just who the hell is this Wuhan?</b>

12:24.910 --> 12:28.470
<b>Master Wuhan was everything to us.</b>

12:29.110 --> 12:34.880
<b>His prophecies brought us wealth
and enabled us to live in peace</b>

12:34.880 --> 12:36.350
<b>until that day.</b>

12:37.350 --> 12:39.650
<b>The day that mist descended
into the gorge,</b>

12:39.650 --> 12:41.790
<b>our fellow townspeople who
were out in their fields</b>

12:41.790 --> 12:44.830
<b>suddenly went crazy and attacked us.</b>

12:44.830 --> 12:48.490
<b>The aura that rules demons that
covered the whole of Shangri-la...</b>

12:50.060 --> 12:54.640
<b>Someone's using it to try
to resurrect Gyumaoh.</b>

12:54.640 --> 12:58.710
<b>You're fighting the ones
who're doing this then?</b>

12:58.710 --> 13:00.830
<b>I'm just heading west.</b>

13:01.380 --> 13:02.840
<b>I see.</b>

13:03.780 --> 13:06.950
<b>Please meet with Master Wuhan,</b>

13:06.950 --> 13:09.350
<b>in order to save this town.</b>

13:09.350 --> 13:12.050
<b>So I'm finally going to see
the one behind all this.</b>

13:27.340 --> 13:29.700
<b>There's one thing I don't understand.</b>

13:30.670 --> 13:32.410
<b>What might that be?</b>

13:32.410 --> 13:37.780
<b>You're a demon, and yet you were
able to maintain your sanity.</b>

13:37.780 --> 13:43.010
<b>My vestments are special,
made by Master Wuhan.</b>

13:44.520 --> 13:47.590
<b>Furthermore, by Master Wuhan's
holy powers,</b>

13:47.590 --> 13:52.960
<b>this town of Tofugai alone
is our Paradise on Earth.</b>

13:57.930 --> 13:59.600
<b>He bestowed these vestments upon me</b>

13:59.600 --> 14:02.240
<b>and evacuated the elderly and
the children to shelter.</b>

14:02.240 --> 14:04.610
<b>Wrong, the aura that makes
demons go crazy</b>

14:04.610 --> 14:08.700
<b>was probably just slow
to reach this place.</b>

14:10.410 --> 14:16.380
<b>Master Wuhan prophesied a savior
would someday come to this land.</b>

14:16.380 --> 14:20.050
<b>Those who've been turned into stone
also quietly await that time.</b>

14:20.050 --> 14:21.590
<b>How arbitrary.</b>

14:21.590 --> 14:25.230
<b>So, he turns those inconvenient
for him to stone with magic</b>

14:25.230 --> 14:28.860
<b>and rules over those who
are docile with threats.</b>

14:28.860 --> 14:31.970
<b>How dare you say that?!
Master Wuhan is absolute!</b>

14:31.970 --> 14:33.570
<b>Even now, he...</b>

14:33.570 --> 14:35.970
<b>Take a look at what's in their hearts!</b>

14:35.970 --> 14:37.670
<b>Robbed of their freedom,
they'll go crazy,</b>

14:37.670 --> 14:39.440
<b>only to suffer for eternity!</b>

14:39.440 --> 14:41.110
<b>That is...</b>

14:41.110 --> 14:44.200
<b>That's not Master Wuhan's true intent.</b>

14:44.750 --> 14:48.350
<b>Master Wuhan only wishes
for peace in this town.</b>

14:48.350 --> 14:50.980
<b>A peace maintained by force.</b>

15:01.130 --> 15:05.030
<b>Master Wuhan, I've brought
the man called Sanzo.</b>

15:06.430 --> 15:08.400
<b>Please awaken.</b>

15:12.310 --> 15:13.740
<b>He's dead.</b>

15:14.380 --> 15:17.240
<b>A mummified monk? Give me a break.</b>

15:18.680 --> 15:20.310
<b>What in the world...</b>

15:24.050 --> 15:27.220
<b>Sanzo, it's good of you to come.</b>

15:27.220 --> 15:29.290
<b>My name's Wuhan.</b>

15:29.290 --> 15:31.460
<b>My duty is to protect the
people of Tofugai</b>

15:31.460 --> 15:35.230
<b>and to guide them down
the correct path.</b>

15:36.530 --> 15:40.470
<b>You just look like a dead
geezer to me.</b>

15:40.470 --> 15:43.340
<b>What's a dead geezer want wih me?</b>

15:47.710 --> 15:49.540
<b>There's no time left.</b>

15:49.540 --> 15:52.610
<b>Soon, the effects of my spell
will wear off,</b>

15:52.610 --> 15:54.750
<b>and the town will collapse.</b>

15:54.750 --> 15:56.840
<b>Then the demons will...</b>

15:58.650 --> 16:01.660
<b>Will you not protect my town?</b>

16:01.660 --> 16:07.330
<b>It must mean something that you
appeared in my final moments.</b>

16:07.330 --> 16:11.670
<b>Your town? Just who do you
think you are?</b>

16:11.670 --> 16:15.840
<b>You enjoy taking pity on
these people as a saint</b>

16:15.840 --> 16:17.770
<b>even after you're dead?</b>

16:17.770 --> 16:19.810
<b>Are you not fighting</b>

16:19.810 --> 16:24.180
<b>because you believe the one ruling
the demons is an unforgivable tyrant?</b>

16:24.180 --> 16:27.170
<b>You're the one ruling the
people of this town!</b>

16:30.150 --> 16:31.620
<b>I'm counting on you.</b>

16:40.560 --> 16:43.800
<b>What you're doing is just for
your own satisfaction!</b>

16:43.800 --> 16:45.430
<b>Don't drag others into this!</b>

16:45.430 --> 16:47.660
<b>Wake up! This place won't hold
much longer! We have to run!</b>

16:49.640 --> 16:51.970
<b>Master Wuhan...</b>

16:54.540 --> 16:58.280
<b>Doctor Ni, Tofugai's being
swallowed up.</b>

16:58.280 --> 17:01.950
<b>I told you, didn't I? All you had to do
was leave it alone.</b>

17:01.950 --> 17:06.010
<b>No! I must remain here to
protect Master Wuhan!</b>

17:07.520 --> 17:11.230
<b>Wake up, forget about a dead
geezer's tedious speeches.</b>

17:11.230 --> 17:13.130
<b>Take a good look at reality
with your own eyes!</b>

17:18.770 --> 17:20.840
<b>This place is going to collapse!
We need to get outside!</b>

17:20.840 --> 17:24.210
<b>We mustn't! They'll all turn to stone!</b>

17:24.210 --> 17:28.880
<b>Stone?! Wrong! What's awaiting them
is a much more terrifying...</b>

17:28.880 --> 17:31.740
<b>No, a much more unpleasant fate!</b>

17:38.050 --> 17:39.520
<b>This is...</b>

17:40.520 --> 17:43.420
<b>This is what's happening
to Shangri-la right now.</b>

17:44.630 --> 17:46.390
<b>Everyone, hear me!</b>

17:46.390 --> 17:48.360
<b>Have you forgotten
Master Wuhan's will?!</b>

17:52.630 --> 17:55.470
<b>Stop this! We're all fellow townsmen!</b>

18:03.110 --> 18:05.740
<b>Can you still not see what's
really happening?</b>

18:06.680 --> 18:10.620
<b>They can see us clearly, as beings
who don't belong!</b>

18:29.940 --> 18:31.270
<b>Kouran...</b>

18:31.270 --> 18:34.810
<b>Sanzo, we'll live on,</b>

18:34.810 --> 18:38.270
<b>but we can't live in the world
as it is now.</b>

18:39.150 --> 18:44.120
<b>We'll wait for the day when
peace will come again.</b>

18:44.120 --> 18:45.750
<b>Do what you want.</b>

18:45.750 --> 18:48.920
<b>But you better return my companions.</b>

18:48.920 --> 18:51.760
<b>Those who wish to live, gather around
and lend me your strength!</b>

18:51.760 --> 18:54.660
<b>Though we know not when it may be,
we will be resurrected!</b>

18:54.660 --> 18:56.400
<b>I want to live!</b>

18:56.400 --> 18:58.560
<b>I'm going to live!</b>

19:05.410 --> 19:07.810
<b>O Tofugai, I seal thee!</b>

19:20.690 --> 19:25.320
<b>Sanzo, thank you for
showing me the truth.</b>

19:33.470 --> 19:37.130
<b>Peace within a tiny glass globe?</b>

19:41.780 --> 19:42.880
<b>I'm hot!</b>

19:42.880 --> 19:46.780
<b>Shut up, you stupid monkey! Your
hot air is just making it hotter!</b>

19:46.780 --> 19:50.420
<b>What, roach-head?! Your overgrown
hair is way more obnoxious!</b>

19:50.420 --> 19:51.450
<b>Cut your hair, Gojyo!</b>

19:51.450 --> 19:52.850
<b>What did you say?!</b>

19:52.850 --> 19:55.920
<b>Hey, Hakkai, aren't we
at the next town yet?</b>

19:55.920 --> 20:00.730
<b>According to the map, the town of
Tofugai should be coming up soon.</b>

20:00.730 --> 20:02.600
<b>If we don't get the pervy water
sprite to a town soon,</b>

20:02.600 --> 20:05.430
<b>the saucer on his head's
gonna dry out.</b>

20:06.700 --> 20:08.740
<b>We have no more water after all.</b>

20:08.740 --> 20:12.000
<b>Yeah, yeah, we had this
conversation yesterday.</b>

20:15.340 --> 20:18.580
<b>Hey, didn't we have a conversation
like this the day before yesterday?</b>

20:18.580 --> 20:19.750
<b>Hey, Sanzo?</b>

20:19.750 --> 20:21.250
<b>Shut up, you stupid monkey!</b>

20:21.250 --> 20:23.480
<b>Hey, you called me stupid!</b>

20:23.480 --> 20:25.320
<b>Quit shouting! You're just
making it hotter!</b>

20:25.320 --> 20:26.550
<b>You eternally dumb monkey!</b>

20:26.550 --> 20:29.120
<b>Shut up! Butt out, anchor water sprite!</b>

20:29.120 --> 20:31.430
<b>Hey, bastard! No one's
allowed to say that!</b>

20:31.430 --> 20:32.560
<b>Wanna settle this once and for all?!</b>

20:32.560 --> 20:32.930
<b>Come and get me!</b>

20:32.930 --> 20:36.160
<b>Shut up! Or I'll turn you
all into stone!</b>

20:36.160 --> 20:37.630
<b>What?</b>

20:40.170 --> 20:46.570
<b>That's right, even sudden
tragedies come</b>

20:46.570 --> 20:51.950
<b>Looking good-natured,
without cause for suspicion</b>

20:51.950 --> 20:57.450
<b>Don't complain, just shut up</b>

20:57.450 --> 21:00.850
<b>And look up</b>

21:00.850 --> 21:06.660
<b>I'll stay in character no matter
how ordinary the scene is</b>

21:06.660 --> 21:12.070
<b>Before any talk of dreams or hopes</b>

21:12.070 --> 21:17.400
<b>It's probably the same for everyone</b>

21:17.400 --> 21:21.340
<b>You must fight against yourself</b>

21:28.350 --> 21:31.990
<b>The sun sets and a new day comes</b>

21:31.990 --> 21:33.950
<b>Repeating is one change</b>

21:33.950 --> 21:38.060
<b>Don't avert eyes from differences</b>

21:38.060 --> 21:42.200
<b>Your nerve and soul to the limit</b>

21:42.200 --> 21:44.870
<b>Go forward now</b>

21:44.870 --> 21:49.940
<b>Standing next to the taut pressure</b>

21:49.940 --> 21:55.340
<b>I'll laugh more boldly and
fearlessly than anyone</b>

21:55.340 --> 22:00.780
<b>It's probably the same for everyone</b>

22:00.780 --> 22:04.810
<b>You must fight against yourself</b>
